WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.077
"Rex!" Sara said.

2
00:00:09.078 --> 00:00:12.329
"Your roar ruined the fort!"

3
00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:18.148
Rex grinned. "Whoops!"

4
00:00:18.149 --> 00:00:22.993
The buddies picked up the sticks.

5
00:00:22.994 --> 00:00:27.596
Sid started stacking sticks.

6
00:00:27.597 --> 00:00:35.432
Tor put some sticks together.

7
00:00:35.433 --> 00:00:41.555
"I'm making the roof," she said.

8
00:00:41.556 --> 00:00:44.819
Sid looked at the roof.

9
00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.822
"It's too low, Tor."

10
00:00:47.823 --> 00:00:52.742
Tor frowned. "It looks fine to me!"

11
00:00:52.743 --> 00:00:56.061
"Sid is right," Sara said.

12
00:00:56.062 --> 00:00:59.578
"That roof is too low."

13
00:00:59.579 --> 00:01:01.805
Tor looked at Rex.

14
00:01:01.806 --> 00:01:05.117
"What do you think?"

15
00:01:05.118 --> 00:01:08.917
Rex bit his lip. "Um . . .

16
00:01:08.918 --> 00:01:12.279
It might be too low."

17
00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:14.640
"Hmph!" Tor said.

18
00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:18.358
"Make the fort without me!"

19
00:01:18.359 --> 00:01:23.349
Tor stomped off.

20
00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:25.853
"Wait!" Sid said.

21
00:01:25.854 --> 00:01:27.683
He turned to follow Tor.

22
00:01:27.684 --> 00:01:30.993
His tail hit the fort.

23
00:01:30.994 --> 00:01:36.351
Crash! The fort fell apart again!

24
00:01:36.352 --> 00:01:40.565
Rex and Sara groaned.

25
00:01:40.566 --> 00:01:42.908
Sid hung his head.

26
00:01:42.909 --> 00:01:45.597
Tor looked back at the mess.

27
00:01:45.598 --> 00:01:52.869
Suddenly she laughed.

28
00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:57.414
"Let's build the fort again!"

